35,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The plasterboard is a single sheet. I can hear every word. The unplanned talk is dead. I need acoustic certainty, not false hope.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I found the numbers. We paid 68,000 yen last year for outside hire. The fit-outs are 141,000 and 96,000. I need to see how this compares to our current monthly costs.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, the tally is wild! Two people near the door used it eleven times, everyone else only four! And the awkward talk happened right in front of everyone!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, the crumbs reveal we eat in silence, not together. The twenty-five minute lunch trip means we rarely share a table. We are physically close, yet emotionally distant.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Eleven callouts for equipment, zero for the empty room. The fridge clear-out was done twice by one person. The hidden labor is real and concentrated.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, the tally confirms the noise source. Two people near the door generate the chaos. I need the partition fixed to secure my acoustic certainty.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, that hidden labor is exactly what I fear. If we don’t fix the room, we keep paying for outside hire. I need to see the monthly totals.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, one person doing the fridge clear-out twice? That’s unfair! I want a fair rule so nobody gets stuck with the mess.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Toshio, that hidden labor is a quiet wound. We must ensure the new arrangement does not simply shift the burden to another silent shoulder.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the labor is already concentrated. If we add more equipment, we risk more callouts. I need to know if the fit-outs reduce that hidden burden or just shift it.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, the 141,000 yen fit-out is the only option that guarantees acoustic certainty. I reject the cheaper alternative. It is a trap for my focus.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I hear you, but 141,000 is a huge jump from our 68,000 annual hire. I need to know if the screen actually stops the noise before I agree to that cost.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Daisuke, I get the money worry! But the tally proves the door people hog the room. We need a fair rule so everyone gets a turn, not just the lucky ones!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, fairness is essential, but connection is the soul. If we only divide time, we remain strangers. We must create a space where difficult words can finally be spoken.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, fairness is necessary, but the data shows the burden falls on one person. We must design a system that prevents that concentration, not just rotate the pain.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shion,,"I stand by my position. The 141,000 yen fit-out is the only path to acoustic certainty. I reject the cheaper alternative. It is a trap for my focus.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m sorry, I’m still anxious. 141,000 yen is a huge risk. I need to see the monthly totals to be sure before I agree to anything.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, exactly! We need a fair rule so the mess doesn’t just move to someone else. I want a system where everyone shares the cleanup, not just the lucky ones!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, I understand your caution. But a room that only protects silence will leave us strangers. We must invest in a space that invites honest conversation, not just quiet.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree with Rin. We must prevent the burden from concentrating on one person again. The data proves that hidden labor is the real cost.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
